   "date": "2019-01-08",
   "text": "New England Coastal Protection Act\n This bill prohibits the Department of the Interior from issuing a lease for the exploration, development, or production of oil or natural gas off the coast of Maine, New Hampshire, Massachusetts, Rhode Island, or Connecticut."
